        <div class="container justify-content-center">

            <h1>Instructions</h1><hr>
            <ul>
            <li>Total number of questions: <strong>20</strong></li>
            <li>Test duration: <strong>60 minutes</strong></li>
            <li>Each correct answer carries <strong>1 mark</strong>. No negative marking.</li>
            <li>You cannot refresh, switch tabs, or close/minimize the browser.</li>
            <li>Multiple violations will lead to <strong>auto-submission</strong>.</li>
            <li>Webcam must remain ON throughout the test.</li>
            <li>Face must remain clearly visible — no other person allowed.</li>
            <li>Copy, Cut, Paste, and taking screenshots are strictly blocked.</li>
            <li>Switching apps or opening another window is not allowed.</li>
            <li>If the camera is disabled or blocked, the test will auto-submit.</li>
            <li>Once submitted, you cannot retake the test.</li>
            <li>Ensure stable internet connection.</li>
            <li>All the best!</li>
            </ul>

            <form action="/user/test/list" method="GET">
                <button type="submit">Start Test</button>
            </form>
    
